## Function-level findings

### 🔴 Move-now

| Symbol | Where | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `core.js:1710 saveConversations` | core.js | Frontend treats itself as authoritative source of conv index, then later syncs. Headless callers can't replicate this state machine. → **Server must expose `/api/v1/conversations/index` with last-writer-wins.** |
| `branch.js` (whole file) | branch.js | Branch tree mutations live entirely in JS. → **Move to `lib/conversations/branches.py` with `/api/v1/conversations/{id}/branches/*` endpoints.** |
| ~~`log-clean.js` (whole file)~~ | ~~log-clean.js~~ | ✅ **Done 2026-05-25.** `lib/log_clean.py` + `POST /api/v1/logs/clean`. JS is now pure fetch+render (272 LOC, was 740). 25 unit tests + 4 integration tests verify parity. |
| `ui.js:3933 renderToolRoundsHTML` | ui.js | Synthesises tool-rounds from raw events client-side. The orchestrator already tracks `toolRounds` server-side — emit the structured array so the API gets the same view. |
| `ui.js:2182 renderFinishInfo` and `:2519 renderFileChangesBar` | ui.js | Derive structured "turn summary" from event log. → **Emit a `turn_summary` event server-side.** |

